The appellant shall deposit the amount of fine (if not deposited) forthwith;
(2). The appellant shall appear before the Trial Court on 12.02.2025 and on such further dates as may be directed by the Trial 3 CRA-12437-2024 Court;
(3). The appellant shall ensure hearing of the appeal on the date fixed for such hearing and shall also ensure proper legal representation on his behalf, on the date notified for hearing.

